    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nIt is not often that a large commercial retail/restaurant building comes for sale close to a large tourist attraction not to mind one which comes to the market beside one of the most visited historic sites in Ireland, The Rock of Cashel. The upper floor offers uninterrupted views of the Rock of Cashel.This building has a large ground floor retail space while the first floor offers ample room for kitchen and sit down area if so desired. Rear access to the property is through the bus/car park of the Rock of Cashel giving a dedicated route to customers.The building has road side access from both roads offering prominence and visibility to passing trade furthermore the direct route from the main M8 Dublin/Cork motorway to the iconic Rock passes the front door.This is a prominent highly visible building with considerable square footage in a prime location.The town centre of Cashel is a short stroll away further adding to the potential of the premises.This is a property offering huge presence with both the tourist footfall and the town footfall all on its doorstep. A highly visual corner building on the edge of the busy junction of Boherlahan Rd/Dublin Road/town centre and Rock of Cashel roads a building could not enjoy more prominence in a town.Cashel town tourist trade has been growing and expanding every year and hold a firm favourite spot in the 'Irelands Ancient East' tourist programme. Visitor numbers currently run in excess of 350k pa.The rejuvenation of the Cashel Palace Hotel has further added another dimension to the town with footfall to the town centre increasing daily on the back of this luxury hotel.The location Cashel town on the M8 Dublin/Cork motorway plays no small part in the attraction of the town. This link opens up the town to easy access from all four corners of Ireland.\nThis building is currently laid out to facilitate retail on ground floor and restaurant cafe on first floor.A once in a lifetime opportunity in Cashel town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nRetail Shop - \nEntrance from both roads, large display windows\n\nStaff facilities & store - \n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Lobby to upper floor - \n\n\nToilets - \n\n\nRear lobby - \nPedestrian access to Rock of Cashel car park with some outdoor dining space\n\nStore Rooms - \n\n\nOpen plan area - \nOpen restauraunt/retail space with views of Rock of Cashel\n\nRear Stairs & Lobby - \n\n\nKitchen/storage/prep areas multiple rooms - \n\n\n"
      },
